138
00:13:10.456 --> 00:13:13.709
Masyado kang mabait, Goem.

139
00:13:16.003 --> 00:13:17.171
hindi ako magaling.

140
00:13:18.214 --> 00:13:21.300
nung narealize ko
na sinubukan niyang magpakamatay

141
00:13:21.842 --> 00:13:23.302
Nagkunwari akong walang alam.

142
00:13:24.553 --> 00:13:26.013
Nanahimik ako hanggang sa huli

143
00:13:27.473 --> 00:13:29.099
