193
00:17:29.089 --> 00:17:30.841
Nakita mo si Chu Ah kahapon, tama ba?

194
00:17:33.969 --> 00:17:36.305
Gusto kong itanong kung may pagkakataon pa ba tayo...

195
00:17:38.932 --> 00:17:40.267
